WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:04.640
Masón.

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:06.200
My brother.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.640
It's been ages.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.040
Glad to see you, brother.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.320
You're looking good, as always.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:14.040
You too.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:15.600
Veronica.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.600
Greg.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.680
How long has it been?

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:25.640
Such a pity,

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:27.400
but I really need to go.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:28.880
Why?

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:30.440
Stay.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:32.240
Haven’t you missed your brother-in-law?

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:37.640
If I am here with your brother,

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:39.320
it doesn't mean I don't think

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:41.480
you're a pig.

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:42.240
Veronica.

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:43.800
Veronica.

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:46.520
Now isn't the time,

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:50.040
but we’ll talk more about this later,

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:51.480
baby girl.
